[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_hhi73")
hearts_table = Dictionary[String, String]({
"10": "One of the wizard's Companions falls in love with a member of this Community, and they run off together. Choose which Companion (or, when in doubt, choose the Water Companion). Ask the wizard what his Companion needs from another, and why he is inadequate. The Companion will refuse to provide Care unless the wizard.",
"2": "Ask the wizard who in this Community has caught his eye and stirs his heart, as he falls in love despite himself. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Hearts to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"3": "Ask the wizard who in this Community he worries for and wishes he could adopt into his own home. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Hearts to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"4": "Someone has fallen in love with the wizard, and refuses to leave him alone — pestering him day in and day out. Ask the wizard why he thinks they're interested in him and whether that's true, and then decide how this benefits the Devil. Choose and move +1 Hearts to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"5": "Two factions within the Community arrange and celebrate a bountiful marriage, ending decades of conflict and uniting their forces. Ask the wizard which two factions these are, and tell him what others stand to lose now that they're working together. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Hearts to the Devil's Deck.",
"6": "A prominent lady within the Community is seduced by another man and runs away from her husband, throwing the Community into turmoil. Ask the wizard what this relationship served in the Community, and describe what has been broken in the face of its collapse. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Hearts to the Devil's Deck.",
"7": ". The Community centers itself around an inn, tavern, opium den, or hunting club. Ask the wizard how the Community seeks pleasure, and tell him how these tools are being used to negotiate power behind closed doors and exclude others. Create a Conspiracy in this Community with the Goal of Treachery.",
"8": "The Community becomes deeply invested in an apocalyptic prophecy, and see themselves as beneficiaries of an upcoming change in the social order. Ask the wizard what the Community believes, and ask the Sage why this cannot come to pass. Give both the wizard and the Sage a Complication.",
"9": "The Community devotes themselves in secret to a dark power, who gives them pleasure and fulfills their vices while consuming their bodies and minds. Tell the wizard what form this devotion takes and how one can identify its members. Create an Antagonist in this Domain with the Goal of Treachery, then give a Complication to every wizard.",
"Ace": "The Community grows compassionate, and their hearts are warm and full of love. Ask the wizard how this manifests, and then tell him the sinister undercurrent that lies beneath. Choose and move +2 Hearts to the Devil's Deck.",
"Jack": "A beautiful young lady has been welcomed into the Community, who wins the heart of every man who looks upon her. Place this card in the wizard's possession. Every month this artist remains alive, it is the same as if the Devil himself was spending time meddling within that Domain. If this woman is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"King": "The Chalice of the wizard-King (page XXXX) arrives at the wizard's door. Place this card in the wizard's possession to represent the Artifact. If this artifact is disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"Queen": "Ask the wizard to describe his ideal lover. This person has arrived before the wizard, fleeing terrible danger and begging for his kindness. If he accepts, he replaces his current Companion caring for his Water with this lover, and gains +1 Water for as long as the lover shares in his bed. Place this card in the wizard's possession. For each month the Companion remains present, choose and move +1 Hearts cards to the Devil's Deck. If this person is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations."
})
clubs_table = Dictionary[String, String]({
"10": "One of the wizard's Companions has grown fascinated with the occult, and demands he share the secrets of his magic with them. Choose which Companion (or, when in doubt, choose the Fire Companion). Ask the wizard what magic his Companion seeks, and how this bruises his ego. The Companion will refuse to provide Care until the wizard Spends Time teaching them the secrets of magic.",
"2": "Ask the wizard who in this Community keeps pestering him about the secrets of magic. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Clubs to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"3": "Ask the wizard who in this Community taught the wizard much of his knowledge. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Clubs to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"4": "An artist emerges in the Community, someone with a beautiful vision uniting the Community and highlighting their worth. Ask the wizard what they depict and why the Community becomes so caught up in it, and then decide how this benefits the Devil. Choose and move +1 Clubs to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"5": "The Community rejects the laws and traditions that have guided them in favor of outside approaches and philosophies. Ask the wizard what the Community no longer believes in, and tell him what essential quality of the Community has been lost. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Clubs to the Devil's Deck.",
"6": "A fire sweeps through the Community's homes, and many believe it was caused by the practice of illegal magic. Ask the wizard to describe a beautiful place within this Community, and describe how the fire has irreparably warped and mangled it. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Clubs to the Devil's Deck.",
"7": "The Community forms a scholarly society, a group of intellectuals preserving their Community's history from a new perspective. Ask the wizard how the Community studies itself, and tell him how these tools are being used to warp the past and justify power. Create a Conspiracy in this Community with the Goal of Calamity.",
"8": "Members of the Community are flagrantly and openly practicing magic against the laws of the Pact, returning the dead to life and binding imps to their will. Ask the wizard what the Community desires, then ask the Necromancer how the returned dead provide this to them. Give both the wizard and the Necromancer a Complication.",
"9": "The Community devotes themselves in secret to a dark power, who offers them ancient wisdom in exchange for cruel rituals and unspeakable acts. Tell the wizard what form this devotion takes and how one can identify its members. Create an Antagonist in this Domain with the Goal of Calamity, then give a Complication to every wizard.",
"Ace": "The Community grows obsessive and manic, and a longing for invention and artwork fills their hearts. Ask the wizard how this manifests, and then tell him the sinister undercurrent that lies beneath. Choose and move +2 Clubs to the Devil's Deck.",
"Jack": "An old man who claims to be a former member of the Seven-Part Pact takes shelter amongst this Community. Place this card in the wizard's possession. Every month this old man remains alive, it is the same as if the Devil himself was spending time meddling within that Domain. If this man is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"King": "The Staff of the wizard-King (page XXXX) arrives at the wizard's door. Place this card in the wizard's possession to represent the Artifact. If this artifact is disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"Queen": "A charming man in expensive clothes and with a marvelous wit arrives before the wizard, confessing his admiration of the wizard's magic and offering access to his expansive library. If he accepts, he replaces his current Companion caring for his Fire with this scholar, and gains +1 Fire for as long as the scholar serves as his friend. Place this card in the wizard's possession. For each month the Companion remains present, choose and move +1 Clubs cards to the Devil's Deck. If this man is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations."
})
diamonds_table = Dictionary[String, String]({
"10": "One of the wizard's Companions grows sick of their lifestyle and demands to return home, to reconnect with their family and society. Choose which Companion (or, when in doubt, choose the Earth Companion). Ask the wizard what magic his Companion seeks, and why he is inadequate. The Companion will refuse to provide Care unless the wizard can convince them otherwise.",
"2": "Ask the wizard who in this Community gives him little gifts when he's passing through, like bread or new hats. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"3": "Ask the wizard who in this Community welcomes him into their family, and offers him a seat at their table. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"4": "A merchant emerges in the Community, someone with a plan to earn the Community wealth beyond their wildest dreams. Ask the wizard what they broker in and why the Community becomes so caught up in it, and then decide how this benefits the Devil. Choose and move +1 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"5": "The Community takes advantage of another Community, earning fortune and fame through the exploitation of others. Ask the wizard what the Community profits off of, and tell him what they've lost in their pursuit of wealth. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck.",
"6": "Thieves strike the heart of the Community, taking away its most treasured and precious relics. Ask the wizard what material goods the Community valued most, and describe what has been left in its stead. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck.",
"7": "The Community forms a guild, union, or parliament, which represents its desires to outsiders and negotiates on its behalf. Ask the wizard how the Community represents itself, and tell him how these tools are being used to consolidate power and betray others. Create a Conspiracy in this Community with the Goal of Extinction.",
"8": "Members of the Community grow dismissive of the old ways, turning against their traditions and embracing the wealth and power promised by modernity. Ask the wizard what the Community needs, then ask the Hierophant why the Temples cannot give this to them. Give both the wizard and the Hierophant a Complication.",
"9": "The Community devotes themselves in secret to a dark power, who showers them in wealth and fortune in exchange for miserable offerings of blood and pain. Tell the wizard what form this devotion takes and how one can identify its members. Create an Antagonist in this Domain with the Goal of Extinction, then give a Complication to every wizard.",
"Ace": "The Community grows wealthy and cheerful, and their coffers fill with coins and plenty of food. Ask the wizard how this manifests, and then tell him the sinister undercurrent that lies beneath. Choose and move +2 Diamonds to the Devil's Deck.",
"Jack": "A small child who claims to be a prophet is welcomed by the Community and revered for his foresight. Place this card in the wizard's possession. Every month this child remains alive, it is the same as if the Devil himself was spending time meddling within that Domain. If this child is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"King": "The Crown of the wizard-King (page XXXX) arrives at the wizard's door. Place this card in the wizard's possession to represent the Artifact. If this artifact is disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"Queen": "A beautiful woman in simple clothes arrives before the wizard, offering to cook and clean for him and help him get his life in order. If he accepts, he replaces his current Companion caring for his Earth with this maid, and gains +1 Earth for as long as the maid serves as his help. Place this card in the wizard's possession. For each month the Companion remains present, choose and move +1 Diamond to the Devil's Deck. If this woman is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations."
})
spades_table = Dictionary[String, String]({
"10": "In a random and heartless act of violence, one of the wizard's Companions is horrifically killed by a member of their Community. Choose which Companion (or, when in doubt, choose the Air Companion). Ask the wizard why he couldn't save them, and what he'd give to get them back. This Companion can no longer provide their Care.",
"2": "Ask the wizard who in this Community is resentful and hostile towards him. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Spades to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"3": "Ask the wizard who in this Community he carries a grudging respect for, despite disagreements. Create a new character, and determine how this character is influenced by the Devil. Choose and move +1 Spades to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"4": "A rabble-rouser emerges in the Community, someone who calls for violence and demands their isolation from outsiders. Ask the wizard what they preach and why the Community becomes so caught up in it, and then decide how this benefits the Devil. Choose and move +1 Spades to the Devil's Deck. Then put a Pawn on this Community.",
"5": "A division within the Community comes to blows, as two factions turn against one another. Ask the wizard which two factions they are, and tell him what simmering resentment has finally boiled over into outright violence. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Spades to the Devil's Deck.",
"6": "A prominent member of the Community is found dead, and no one in the Community knows who to trust. Ask the wizard who this Community looked up to and who they think the killer was, then decide who the killer really was. Give the wizard an associated Complication, then choose and move +1 Spades to the Devil's Deck.",
"7": "The Community forms their own neighborhood watch, ostensibly to keep the Community itself safe. Ask the wizard how the Community protects itself, and tell him how these tools are being used to enforce power and mistreat the downtrodden. Create a Conspiracy in this Community with the Goal of Subjugation.",
"8": "The Community rebels openly against the will of the King, and violence breaks out between them and the King's Guard. Ask the wizard what the Community demands, then ask the Warlock why the King would never give it to them. Give both the wizard and the Warlock a Complication.",
"9": "The Community devotes themselves in secret to a dark power, who gives them might and safety in exchange for cruel mutilation and sacrifice. Tell the wizard what form this devotion takes and how one can identify its members. Create an Antagonist in this Domain with the Goal of Subjugation, then give a Complication to every wizard.",
"Ace": "The Community sours towards others, and a longing for violence and cruelty  poisons their hearts. Ask the wizard how this manifests, and then tell him how it's even worse than he realizes. Choose and move +2 Spades to the Devil's Deck.",
"Jack": "A passionate man is embraced by the Community, and viewed as a legitimate contender for the throne of Isha. Place this card in the wizard's Domain. Every month this challenger remains alive, it is the same as if the Devil himself was spending time meddling within that Domain. If this man is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"King": "The Sword of the wizard-King (page XXXX) arrives at the wizard's door. Place this card in the wizard's possession to represent the Artifact. If this artifact is disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations.",
"Queen": "A handsome knight has arrived before the wizard from a faraway land, warning of a grave threat to his safety and offering him his protection. If he accepts, he replaces his current Companion caring for his Air with this knight, and gains +1 Air for as long as the knight serves as his guard. Place this card in the wizard's possession. For each month the Companion remains present, choose and move +1 Spades cards to the Devil's Deck. If this man is slain or disposed of, place this card in the Devil's Machinations."
})
